## What was built

The completed board work produced a fully functional single-page marketing
landing page for Lumen, including:

- **Hero Section** — Prominent headline, supporting subheadline, and primary
  call-to-action button. Styled with modern Inter typography, polished gradient
  background, and responsive layout for all screen sizes.

- **Features Section** — A responsive grid of feature cards (3–6 items),
  each with a custom SVG icon, feature title, and descriptive text. The grid
  adapts from three columns on desktop to a single column on mobile.

- **Contact Form Section** — A complete contact form with labeled inputs
  for name, email, and message, client-side validation with accessible error
  messages, submit handling with loading state, and graceful fallback to
  `mailto:` when the backend is unavailable.

- **Foundation** — CSS reset, base typography, utility classes, and a
  cohesive design system (CSS variables, `clamp()` for fluid sizing,
  consistent color palette, and accessible focus states).

- **Polish** — Smooth scroll behavior, gradient backgrounds, subtle shadows,
  hover transitions on interactive elements, and a professional visual
  treatment throughout.